Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 06:49:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 50/59] BOX2: Inflate and point distance without int overflow
 (backport of master 6eaa6bba)

Upstream commit 6eaa6bba6 "Fix BOX2 point distance and Inflate" by Seth Hillbrand.
Inflate() computed -2 * dx and m_Pos -= dx in int and wrapped for boxes near the
edge of the coordinate range (UBSan in box2.h:562-603 from SVG plotting of
footprints with huge coordinates). The upstream fix widens to 64 bits and
saturates; SquaredDistance() also used the wrong far edge.
The new test in test_shape_arc.cpp is left out (it depends on other master changes).

Found by tools/bughunt (kicad-ja-plus, run 39090891417).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
